#: macports.md:1
msgid "Installing PLUMED with MacPorts"
msgstr "MacPorts でのインストール"

#: macports.md:3
msgid ""
"If you are using a Mac, notice that you can take advantage of a MacPorts "
"package. Installing a working plumed should be as easy as:"
msgstr "Mac は MacPorts Package を使えます。次だけで済むはずです。"

#: macports.md:6
msgid "Install [MacPorts](https://www.macports.org/)"
msgstr "[MacPorts](https://www.macports.org/) を入れる。"

#: macports.md:7
msgid "Type `sudo port install plumed`"
msgstr "`sudo port install plumed` を実行する。"

#: macports.md:9
msgid ""
"Notice that plumed comes with many variants that can be inspected with the "
"command"
msgstr "Variant は次で確認できます。"

#: macports.md:15
msgid ""
"Plumed uses variants to support different compilers. For instance, you can "
"install plumed with mpich using"
msgstr "Compiler などを Variant で選べます。mpich の例は、"

#: macports.md:22
msgid ""
"Using more recent clang instead of native compilers is recommended so as to "
"take advantage of openMP"
msgstr "OpenMP のため Native より新しい clang を推奨します。"

#: macports.md:29
msgid ""
"Notice that support for c++17 with gcc compilers is someway problematic "
"within MacPorts due to impossibility to use the system c++ library. For this"
" reason, only clang compilers are supported (see also [this "
"discussion](https://github.com/macports/macports-ports/pull/1252))."
msgstr ""
"MacPorts の GCC は System C++ Library が使えず C++17 に問題があるため、clang "
"のみ対応します（[議論](https://github.com/macports/macports-ports/pull/1252)）。"

#: macports.md:33
msgid ""
"Variants can be also used to compile with debug flags (`+debug`), to pick a "
"linear algebra library (e.g. `+openblas`) and to enable all optional modules"
" (`+allmodules`). Notice that the default variant installed with `sudo port "
"install plumed` is shipped as a compiled binary, which is significantly "
"faster to install."
msgstr ""
"Debug（`+debug`）、線形代数（`+openblas`）、全 Module（`+allmodules`）も選べます。既定の `sudo "
"port install plumed` は Binary 配布で、導入が大幅に速くなります。"

#: macports.md:38
msgid ""
"In addition, we provide a developer version (typically: a later version not "
"yet considered as stable) under the subport `plumed-devel` that can be "
"installed with"
msgstr "未安定の開発版 `plumed-devel` もあります。"

#: macports.md:45
msgid ""
"`plumed-devel` also supports the same variants as `plumed` in order to "
"customize the compilation. `plumed-devel` and `plumed` cannot be installed "
"at the same time."
msgstr ""
"`plumed-devel` は `plumed` と同じ Variant に対応しますが、`plumed-devel` と `plumed` "
"は同時に入れられません。"

#: macports.md:48
msgid ""
"It is also possible to install a plumed-patched version of gromacs. For "
"instance, you can use the following command to install gromacs patched with "
"plumed with clang-5.0 compiler and mpich:"
msgstr "Patch 済み GROMACS も入れられます。clang-5.0・mpich の例は、"

#: macports.md:57
msgid ""
"In case you want to combine gromacs with the unstable version of plumed, use"
" this instead:"
msgstr "不安定版 PLUMED との組み合わせは、"

#: macports.md:64
msgid ""
"Notice that gromacs should be compiled using the same compiler variant as "
"plumed (in this example `+mpich +clang50`). In case this is not true, "
"compilation will fail."
msgstr ""
"GROMACS は PLUMED と同じ Compiler Variant（ここは `+mpich +clang50`）が必要で、違うと失敗します。"

#: macports.md:68
msgid ""
"Also notice that gromacs is patched with plumed in runtime mode but that the"
" path of libplumedKernel.dylib in the MacPorts tree is hard coded. As a "
"consequence:"
msgstr ""
"Runtime Patch ですが、MacPorts の libplumedKernel.dylib の Path は固定されています。そのため、"

#: macports.md:72
msgid ""
"If gromacs is run with `PLUMED_KERNEL` environment variable unset (or set to"
" empty), then the MacPorts plumed is used."
msgstr "`PLUMED_KERNEL` が未設定・空なら MacPorts 版を使う。"

#: macports.md:75
msgid ""
"If gromacs is run with `PLUMED_KERNEL` environment variable pointing to "
"another instance of the plumed library, the other instance is used."
msgstr "`PLUMED_KERNEL` が別の Library を指せばそちらを使う。"

#: macports.md:78
msgid ""
"This is especially useful if you are developing PLUMED since you will be "
"able to install gromacs once for all and combine it with your working "
"version of PLUMED."
msgstr "GROMACS を1回だけ入れ、開発中の PLUMED と組み合わせられるため便利です。"
